 "intro_zh": "凯奥拉德奥国家公园位于默哈拉杰。以前这里是猎鸭地区，现在是大批水禽鸟类冬季栖息的重要地区。这些水禽来自阿富汗、土库曼斯坦、中国和西伯利亚。364种鸟在公园里已经记录在册，其中包括稀有的西伯利亚鹤。",
 "intro_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_en": "This former duck-hunting reserve of the Maharajas is one of the major wintering areas for large numbers of aquatic birds from Afghanistan, Turkmenistan, China and Siberia. Some 364 species of birds, including the rare Siberian crane, have been recorded in the park.",
